        <activityName xml:lang="en">Powertrain, for electric scooter</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Powertrain, for electric scooter
This dataset describes the production of an electric drivetrain suitable for an electric scooter. It comprises the controller (1.27), the electric motor and the charger (3.025kg). The entries are given on a function of kg of device. The dataset is based on direct inspection of existing commercial devices of current technology.;
UUID: ad23a7a1-f6b1-3756-a520-30b0578a4fff
The dataset brings together all the devices required for the electric drivetrain. The dataset returns the electric drivetrain and includes the treatment of the used component.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Unspecified
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 7800000 kg
Sampling: Direct inspection of a typical devices of common technology. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ad23a7a1-f6b1-3756-a520-30b0578a4fff.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
